.TH GRID_CELL_RECT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_cell_rect \- Screen rectangle of item i with the current scroll applied and the gap removed, so it is the box to draw the item into
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "Rect grid_cell_rect(const Grid *g, int i);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Screen rectangle of item i with the current scroll applied and the gap removed, so it is the box to draw the item into. Defined for any i, even one scrolled out of the window; use grid_visible or the grid_first_visible..grid_end_visible range to draw only what shows.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_visible (3),
.BR grid_first_visible (3),
.BR grid_end_visible (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
